      "heading_context": "## Decision Cheat Sheet",
      "headers": [
        "Question",
        "Answer"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "What is trophic efficiency?",
          "~10% of energy transfers to next trophic level"
        ],
        [
          "What is a keystone species?",
          "Species with outsized ecological impact relative to biomass"
        ],
        [
          "What happens when sea otters are removed?",
          "Urchin explosion → kelp forest collapse → urchin barrens"
        ],
        [
          "What is MSY?",
          "Maximum Sustainable Yield: harvest at K/2 population for logistic growth"
        ],
        [
          "Why did Grand Banks cod not recover after 30 years?",
          "Ecosystem restructured; prey species (capelin) also collapsed; regime shift"
        ],
        [
          "What pH has ocean surface water dropped to?",
          "From ~8.2 (pre-industrial) to ~8.1 (2024) — 26% more H⁺"
        ],
        [
          "What is ocean dead zone?",
          "Hypoxic coastal zone (<2 mg/L O₂) from nutrient runoff + algal bloom + decomposition"
        ],
        [
          "What % of ocean is fully protected?",
          "~3% (no-take) as of 2024"
        ]
      ]
    }
